            <ArticleTitle>The clinical use of intravenous verapamil.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1070-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The mechanisms of action and clinical application of verapamil--a calcium ion antagonist--are reviewed. Verapamil is effective and has important application in the treatment of coronary artery spasm, hypertensive crises, and supraventricular tachyarrhythmias.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
